apn-autoconfig-lpac
===================

This package contains a build of lpac, an eUICC LPA written in C, together with
a launcher written for this project.

Upstream
--------

  lpac, by ESTKME TECHNOLOGY LIMITED, Hong Kong, and contributors
  https://github.com/estkme-group/lpac

  Pinned to tag v2.3.0, commit c2fcf5e4b21c712d54e35a11da2ad9ad134fb821,
  source archive sha256
  661dffbd1e9e5732dab4a0bb0a9837d4906c8c66bd748bda262fe3e8d3e420f6.

  The pinned archive and every patch applied to it are installed under
  /usr/share/apn-autoconfig-lpac/source, so the corresponding source for the
  binary in this package is present on the device that runs it.

